Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on a journey out to see\Nthe world While I'm on my own,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I've yet to reach the end So won't\Nyou come along with me right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.08,0:00:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely then we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.80,0:00:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me now as we\Njourney on from sea to sea
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.02,0:00:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,For that treasure known\Nby everybody as One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.44,0:00:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though they laugh and\Nsay it's just a fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.68,0:00:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We are going, there's no doubt we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.94,0:00:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we can feel the\Nrush of energy overcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It will lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep pretending that you know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Books will only get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.48,0:01:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No guides for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.14,0:01:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not worry soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.52,0:01:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The rain will be gone with the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.08,0:01:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your chin up, raise the anchor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's what you'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.71,0:01:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it time and calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.84,0:01:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The storm that you have built within.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.38,0:01:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Manhattan, our board at number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.48,0:01:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Once tomorrow's wind picks up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.62,0:01:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We set stuff cause we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.86,0:01:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thresh enough, stand tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.98,0:01:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And take a look at one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.36,0:01:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All the journey makes\Nme want to see somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.74,0:01:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There are things out there\Nyou just won't believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.40,0:01:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.68,0:01:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.38,0:01:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.48,0:01:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.88,0:01:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Most will believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.80,0:01:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.14,0:01:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.32,0:01:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I am on a journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.86,0:01:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Out to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.86,0:01:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The world done on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.80,0:01:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,On my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.71,0:01:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got my group of friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Together we've got our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.44,0:01:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.04,0:01:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Says your captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.12,0:01:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who says it can't be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.36,0:01:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't even tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.02,0:01:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta just believe we'll\Nmake it to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.02,0:01:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanna do it all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.66,0:02:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Together surely we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.92,0:02:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.80,0:02:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.20,0:02:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take this moment in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.82,0:02:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.14,0:02:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.52,0:02:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take this feeling in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.24,0:02:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.56,0:02:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.76,0:02:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.32,0:02:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.48,0:02:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.62,0:02:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a prehistoric mammoth?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.66,0:02:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.57,0:02:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemies wanted what you didn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.56,0:02:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There was nothing you\Ncould do, you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.02,0:02:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Rizal, huh? From Wanhole?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.52,0:02:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We've never heard of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.86,0:03:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we can't help!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.02,0:03:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.88,0:03:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all minx here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.94,0:03:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Legends really are true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.28,0:03:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A whole country of you talking fleabags.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.16,0:03:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.34,0:03:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And just who are you, Karoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.72,0:03:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.63,0:03:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, who are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.80,0:03:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look, stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.04,0:03:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You've never heard of this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.38,0:03:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Our leader is one of the three disasters,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.00,0:03:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,which means he's a top member\Nof Emperor Kaido's crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.32,0:03:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's feared far and wide\Nas Jack the Drought.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.50,0:03:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And how did he earn\Nthat title, you may ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.36,0:03:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Every nation he passes\Nthrough is left so barren,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.62,0:03:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,it looks like they suffered a drought.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.16,0:03:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we wouldn't want your country\Nto meet such a cruel fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.82,0:03:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So hand over Race, or your children\Nwon't have a future anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.72,0:03:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.72,0:03:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to fight Jack? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.06,0:04:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.98,0:04:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A fight's the last thing we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.30,0:04:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Margie!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.32,0:04:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.18,0:04:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If you, Karoo, would only listen\Nto us, we could make peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.90,0:04:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The man you want cannot be found on Zo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.82,0:04:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Jack, I promise,\Nwe minks do not tell lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.38,0:04:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If you, Karoo, want to search for Race,\Nyou're free to go door to door all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.72,0:04:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Women, children, who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.28,0:04:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.04,0:04:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinrumi, we are not here to talk. Are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.36,0:04:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, sir, Master Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.28,0:04:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here for Raizo,\Nthe samurai from Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.96,0:04:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.87,0:04:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not a samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.79,0:04:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Raizo is a ninja. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.28,0:04:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I don't know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.86,0:04:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Samurai is a general term.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.60,0:05:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They use it all the time. Uh-uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.92,0:05:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A ninja is a ninja!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.34,0:05:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring Raizo to me or face destruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.44,0:05:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no negotiation!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.50,0:05:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So it was Kaido's crew that attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.88,0:05:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And they're the Beast Pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.24,0:05:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.18,0:05:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not lying! Really!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.56,0:05:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know any rhizo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.66,0:05:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What else can we say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.28,0:05:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Find gold pleasures!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.30,0:05:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Search every last inch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.50,0:05:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.96,0:05:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.02,0:05:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll show him what we're made of!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.90,0:05:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.00,0:06:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you idiots doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.16,0:06:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That power is just pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.42,0:06:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We're peaceful, but that\Ndoesn't mean we're weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.04,0:06:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Every mink has a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.94,0:06:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,From our birth, we're given this strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.28,0:06:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Even a child won't be bested easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.32,0:06:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You, Karoo, may be strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.14,0:06:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,but do you think you can fight\Nevery single person in this country?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.34,0:06:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We have highly trained musketeers as well;
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.94,0:06:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,their power is far beyond\Nanything seen here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.54,0:06:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If we fight, then both of us\Nwill suffer needless casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.22,0:06:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you, Karoo, are intent\Non finding this, Rhizo,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.62,0:06:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,then why not meet with the Duke\Nof our country and talk it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.82,0:07:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.54,0:07:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.94,0:07:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Gifters, you're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.50,0:07:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.38,0:07:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, geez.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.26,0:07:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.78,0:07:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.69,0:07:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Find that ninja!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.10,0:07:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy everything in your path!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.68,0:07:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They wouldn't listen to a word we said.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.46,0:07:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though they had nothing to gain,\Nthey turned Kuro City into a battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.80,0:07:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We were forced to either fight or die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.00,0:07:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There were countless injuries,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.86,0:07:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,so those who could walk had\Nto carry those who could not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.72,0:08:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a terrible sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.78,0:08:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We also don't know how he managed\Nto make his way to our country,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.48,0:08:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,or why he was so certain that Raizo\Nwas here despite our protests.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.64,0:08:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Usa, bet that mammoth was huge, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.78,0:08:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh, get excited later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.18,0:08:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Raid out Rome! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.24,0:08:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.38,0:08:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch what you say to the Minx.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.30,0:08:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So no, ninja, samurai,\Nor land of Wano talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.32,0:08:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.92,0:08:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What awful people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.90,0:08:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If they find out that Kin'emon has a\Npossible connection to this tragedy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.02,0:08:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,it could be a complete disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.90,0:08:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What a bummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.90,0:08:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.92,0:08:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.08,0:08:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's that ninja from Wano?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.12,0:08:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon wanted to see him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.10,0:08:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.44,0:08:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.20,0:08:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.18,0:08:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.78,0:09:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninja?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.12,0:09:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.42,0:09:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Bulldog!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.48,0:09:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.54,0:09:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So you are familiar with that, Drum.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.92,0:09:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Yutia must know something about Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.08,0:09:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think you simply misheard him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.22,0:09:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What he actually said was, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.04,0:09:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Injured!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.95,0:09:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's worried about your injured dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.10,0:09:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I like Mink's ship anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.24,0:09:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So, uh, we'll be there soon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.62,0:09:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can see the\Nsanatorium straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.50,0:09:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Tia, for coming along.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.64,0:09:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I can finish the story another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.76,0:09:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.34,0:09:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't mean to!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.60,0:09:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Mercy, show mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.16,0:10:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Cecilion's on a rampage!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.84,0:10:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.40,0:10:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Cecilion, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.24,0:10:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello, Wanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.06,0:10:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Those fools kept spewing\Nsome sugary nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.36,0:10:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So I taught them a lesson and\Ntossed them straight off a ledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.76,0:10:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cupcakes, match, love,\Nbabies, sugar, and honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.04,0:10:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Never speak these sickeningly\Nsweet words in my presence,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.64,0:10:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,or I'll tear your windpipes out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.90,0:10:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, pull it together and climb back up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.06,0:10:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's true kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.92,0:10:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you gotta say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.40,0:10:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mere seconds after my scathing\Nrebuke, you fools get sappy again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.28,0:10:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you gotta!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.74,0:11:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt, but he's so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.86,0:11:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We're sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.22,0:11:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never say anything sweet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.60,0:11:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Say that you gotta don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.36,0:11:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Sashillian.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.34,0:11:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.26,0:11:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,These people here are\Nthe Straw Hat Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.00,0:11:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta have my boundless\Ngratitude for saving this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.72,0:11:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a lifelong death\Nthat I can never repay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.92,0:11:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Shishilian always puts his\Nfull power into everything he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.92,0:11:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should hold back a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.92,0:11:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta may see the Duke.\NCome inside. Don't delay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.96,0:11:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, they're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.74,0:12:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my grace, I'm so glad you're well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.68,0:12:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So you Karoo are the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.46,0:12:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe you Karoo for the\Nlives of everyone on Zo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.38,0:12:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Words cannot express my things.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.88,0:12:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard my crew saved\Nyou, but I just got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.48,0:12:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So I still don't know the whole story yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.80,0:12:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you Karoo weren't all\Nhere, the whole crew played a part.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.68,0:12:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I bet you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.64,0:12:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, really strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.02,0:12:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course! Don't be rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.42,0:12:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Our duke is the mightiest\Nwarrior in the whole country.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.04,0:12:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet I lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.80,0:12:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Praising my strength now as cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.34,0:12:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That was not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.76,0:12:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The Beast Pirates were mighty indeed, but\NYutia still maintained the upper hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.66,0:12:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It was...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.36,0:12:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A poison gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.08,0:13:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.04,0:13:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Know what that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.50,0:13:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The gas used on this place was\None of Caesar's weapons And I see
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.14,0:13:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,the connection now Kaido's bio-weapons\Ncame straight from Doflamingo
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.28,0:13:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.88,0:13:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.48,0:13:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.76,0:13:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be admiring our\Nsavior, Baron Corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.90,0:13:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What a delectable-looking hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.54,0:13:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he's tempting,\Nbut you're still injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.38,0:13:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.48,0:13:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How about you don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.22,0:13:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm already!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.22,0:13:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't help but notice that hat\Nit suits you Karoo very well pirate
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.74,0:14:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,takes me back to my youth ah traveling
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.02,0:14:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,with damn it what's that cat's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.02,0:14:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,name it's master cat viper sir I\Nwas sailing the seas with that fool
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.08,0:14:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,many years ago there was a young\Nman with a hat just like yours he's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.60,0:14:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,an emperor now his name was shanks\Nyou used to sail with shakes really
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.74,0:14:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,actually this hat belongs\Nto him and hey rude
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.86,0:14:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,it is already six o\N'clock what is he a baby
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.86,0:14:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,wake up boss dog as i mentioned\Nbefore the mokumo duktim is
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.08,0:14:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,governed by two rulers though they\Nnever ruled during the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.78,0:14:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke Dogstorm is the official\Nsovereign of this nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.88,0:14:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The Master Cat Viper, who guards the Sacred\NWhale Forest, possesses equal authority,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.00,0:14:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,at least when the night falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.72,0:15:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's interesting and all, but what does\Nit have to do with a Duke falling asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.68,0:15:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I see a happy move!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.82,0:15:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,To say they hate each other\Nwould be an understatement.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.20,0:15:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If they met face to face, it's possible\Nthat they would fight to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.08,0:15:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight to the death? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.66,0:15:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They were once friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.42,0:15:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,but whatever happened between\Nthem, they don't talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.18,0:15:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, at any rate,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.80,0:15:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,the two of them possess equal power, both\Nas kings and as mighty make warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.64,0:15:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,They ended up fighting so often that they\Ndecided to never see each other again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.38,0:15:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So one rules under the sun, from six\Nin the morning to six in the evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.36,0:15:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And the other rules under the moon, from\Nsix in the evening to six in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.38,0:15:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus divided, the two kings ensure\Nthat they never cross paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.54,0:15:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how it got that bad between them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.42,0:16:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.52,0:16:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Even his doctors go to sleep too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.98,0:16:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not only his doctors,\Nbut everyone in the fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.68,0:16:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to nod off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.44,0:16:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that lion bro is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.96,0:16:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Cecilion!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.12,0:16:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Always at full power!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.88,0:16:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, you don't have to yell at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.90,0:16:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The country follows a day and night\Ncycle, just like the two kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.46,0:16:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So those who live in the city are\Nactive during the daylight hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.40,0:16:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and those who live in the forest
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.48,0:16:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,are not terrible like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.94,0:16:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep searching.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.84,0:16:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I know Race is hiding somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.60,0:16:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.02,0:16:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you thug done\Nenough damage already?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.34,0:16:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is getting bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.80,0:16:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the samurai, doggie? Not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.76,0:17:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.30,0:17:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.96,0:17:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.04,0:17:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Here come the musketeers!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.10,0:17:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.32,0:17:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone else step back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.76,0:17:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna handle this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.06,0:17:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus on disarming the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.22,0:17:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Our goal is to minimize the damage! Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.56,0:17:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrot, are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.90,0:17:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.30,0:17:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What are these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.48,0:17:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They're creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.82,0:17:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Some have disturbing powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.08,0:17:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A race that we don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.18,0:18:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear they are something unnatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.42,0:18:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out for the ones with blackhorns!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.68,0:18:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Try my wolf grip!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.22,0:18:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What did he do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.06,0:18:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.14,0:18:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder be countered!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.32,0:18:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta step back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.92,0:18:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They're in trouble now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.42,0:18:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Woohoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.33,0:18:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The three musketeers!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.44,0:18:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All of the musketeers, lead the\Ncitizens to the forest immediately! Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.92,0:18:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,More insects to squash.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.70,0:19:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So you Karoo Jack, stop all of this\Nviolence and destruction at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.44,0:19:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be the ruler.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.78,0:19:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm confused, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.62,0:19:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why drop your blade?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.42,0:19:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall not take up arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.54,0:19:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This samurai is not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.20,0:20:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You, Karoo, are free to search\Nand find out for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.84,0:20:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But let it be done peacefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.86,0:20:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't see our heritage destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.64,0:20:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.54,0:20:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there for the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.34,0:20:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, the poor Duke!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.24,0:20:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,hold up what's with that dog guy he\Nstood there and didn't even flinch
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.38,0:20:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,that's our duke stout-hearted\Nand true i didn't realize they
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.74,0:20:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,had a guy this strong I thought this place\Nwas full of fuzzy, woodland creatures!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.50,0:21:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.40,0:21:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think you're that tough, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.62,0:21:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're up against Master Jack here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.66,0:21:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's feared by all!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.48,0:21:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you know the bounty on his head\Nalone is worth one billion berries?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.38,0:21:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So just because you're a little strong\Ndon't think you can push your lock,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.28,0:21:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.44,0:21:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Blabbing about me, believe me:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.28,0:21:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,we speak the truth;
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.84,0:21:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,we are not concealing the samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.34,0:21:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make this clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.24,0:21:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Your greatest sin is protecting\NRhizo—if you can't find him,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.58,0:21:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,it's your own fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.88,0:21:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He's an insane monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.04,0:21:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.10,0:21:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.14,0:21:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I revel in destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.16,0:21:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.24,0:22:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,is a disaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.70,0:22:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,disaster
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.96,0:22:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Onward!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.92,0:22:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that rain it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.48,0:22:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Goloniago!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.26,0:22:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.60,0:22:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounded like master cat viper's roar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.16,0:22:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The fool of the night has come to\Nplay, then it's time to retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.94,0:22:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we fight with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.56,0:22:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Fall back; switching off\Nwill be to our benefit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.60,0:23:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy will weaken after\Nnot being able to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.16,0:23:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it, jack;
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.36,0:23:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,do not believe that you Karoo\Nare the only stubborn one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.88,0:23:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, for every nation\Nhas its share of fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.58,0:23:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Bolognago!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.60,0:23:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,When the moon goes up, this is my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.22,0:23:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No intruder will escape on my watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.72,0:23:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Entering my home while I sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.60,0:23:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He sleeps, Monster Kitty!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.36,0:24:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.20,0:24:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We have so much to tell you, Grove!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.42,0:24:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, I already\Nheard the whole story.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.48,0:24:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So, if I got this straight, you're\Nlooking for a water warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.20,0:24:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't let a samurai step\Na damn foot on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.34,0:24:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And if one even dared, I would chew\Nthrough every limb on his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.84,0:24:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the fearless cat viper, the man\Nwho waits for the god of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.62,0:24:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.08,0:25:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
